<https://w3id.org/poc-kb/core/component/A> a core:Component, core:NamedThing ; core:head "ENGINE" .
<https://w3id.org/poc-kb/core/component/B> a core:Component, core:NamedThing ; core:head "FUEL SYSTEM" .

# Deliberate negative fixture: CandidateLink score > 1.0 violates CandidateLinkScoreRangeShape.
<https://w3id.org/poc-kb/core/link/BAD_SCORE> a core:CandidateLink, core:NamedThing ;
    core:fromEntity <https://w3id.org/poc-kb/core/component/A> ;
    core:toEntity <https://w3id.org/poc-kb/core/component/B> ;
